{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>הפעם הא'</b><br>מור עובר — like עובר לסוחר." "המנעול — from ונעל הדלת." "<b>הפעם הג'</b><br>קמתי אני לפתוח לדודי וידי נטפו מור. And the meaning is: its shell was good (and not its interior, end of quote). דודי חמק עבר — after he promised me that he would dwell within me, through the verse ושכנתי בתוכך." "נפשי יצאה בדברו — when I recall his word with me."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {2 "The parenthetical (ולא תוכו ע״כ) appears to close a quotation from another commentator; זכריא appears to be a truncated or corrupted citation of a verse reference, possibly Zechariah."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:42.798137082Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}